  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a Bonus Action while your Symbiotic Entity is active, you can hurl spores up to 30 feet away, where they swirl in a 10-foot Cube for 1 minute. They disappear early if you use this feature again, if you dismiss them as a Bonus Action, or if your Symbiotic Entity ends. Whenever a creature moves into the Cube or starts its turn there, it takes your Halo of Spores damage unless it succeeds on a Constitution saving throw against your spell save DC; a creature takes this damage no more than once per turn. While the Cube persists, you can't take your Halo of Spores Reaction.</p>",
